DESCRIPTION                   = "This table contains mineral abundances and
 analytical errors derived from diffraction-all K-alpha diffraction data for
 the Tapo Caparo drill sample, analyzed in CheMin cell number 15a (Kapton
 window). The analysis is based on RDA file
 CMB_730910626RDA37551001084CH00111P1. Mineral identifications, abundances
 and analytical errors for crystalline phases were determined using the
 program JADE. Analysis of the diffraction pattern suggests that small
 amounts of hematite and goethite are present but are below the quantitation
 limit in this sample (~1%). In addition to these crystalline phases, high
 intensity in the low 2-theta region and a broad amorphous hump were modeled
 using FULLPAT to indicate that ~60 +/- 23 weight% of the total sample
 consists of X-ray amorphous materials. All errors cited are 2-sigma. Column
 1 of the table lists mineral identifications, column 2 lists the mineral
 abundances in weight percent, and column 3 indicates the estimated
 analytical errors."
END_OBJECT                    = SPREADSHEET
END

